{"4171850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trees Hate You", "steam_appid": 4171850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a picnic in the woods, it's time to go home. But the nearby flora is determined to take you off course and make your life miserable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.poster.avif?t=1787891955\" aria-label=\"Player character gets shot by a tree\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.webm?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.mp4?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rage game focused on traps and gags. There's a surprise around every corner to keep your hike infuriating. Try to avoid the traps, inevitably die from them, and try again. These trees are unfair, mean, and merciless. They will use your expectations against you to humiliate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.poster.avif?t=1787891955\" aria-label=\"A snowman reveal itself to be a tree and blocks the player&#039;s path. Then a present approaches and exploded nearby.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.webm?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.mp4?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the victim of a variety of bullying methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in several biomes as your journey goes terribly off course</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cool hats (or ugly hats, depending on your fashion sense)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find an axe?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a picnic in the woods, it's time to go home. But the nearby flora is determined to take you off course and make your life miserable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.poster.avif?t=1787891955\" aria-label=\"Player character gets shot by a tree\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.webm?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/669299166737404dbec8aaf55e6ef304.mp4?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rage game focused on traps and gags. There's a surprise around every corner to keep your hike infuriating. Try to avoid the traps, inevitably die from them, and try again. These trees are unfair, mean, and merciless. They will use your expectations against you to humiliate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.poster.avif?t=1787891955\" aria-label=\"A snowman reveal itself to be a tree and blocks the player&#039;s path. Then a present approaches and exploded nearby.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.webm?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/extras/101c949d46e3da7edd2e3b850b4c7d8b.mp4?t=1787891955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the victim of a variety of bullying methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in several biomes as your journey goes terribly off course</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cool hats (or ugly hats, depending on your fashion sense)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find an axe?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Hike through the worst forest full of the most horrible trees. Do not trust them. The trees will trick you. They will bully you. They will hurt you. If only you could find an axe...", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4171850/4550c09c2fa41435b7b695f31460bea297d4ce15/header.jpg?t=1787891955", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite